# JavaScript rules

## File structure

- Single app file: `assets/js/scripts-{timestamp}.js`
- Wrapped in IIFE: `(function () { "use strict"; ... })()`
- Use `const` arrow functions for helpers
- Init on `window.onload`; page-specific logic in `setLocationSpecific()`

