## Patterns to follow

```javascript
// Cache-then-fetch
const cached = localStorage.getItem(KEY);
if (cached) { /* apply to DOM */ }
fetch(url)
  .then(resp => resp.ok ? resp.json() : null)
  .then(json => { localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(json)); /* update DOM */ })
  .catch(err => console.error("...", err));
```

## Do not

- Manually rename `scripts-*.js` or edit script `src` in HTML (gulp precommit handles this)
- Use `eval`, inline event handlers, or `innerHTML` with untrusted API data without sanitising
- Add npm runtime dependencies — this is zero-dependency client JS

## Annual maintenance

Update hardcoded dates in `isRamadan()` and `isEid()` when Islamic calendar dates change.
